{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜個別握手会でしたん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんとたんたんとたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服2着きたのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一枚目撮り忘れたああああーーーっっ！！！  (´༎ຶ۝༎ຶ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/22/4175325/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか可愛らしいポーズきめちゃってる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギンガムチェックの肩出しワンピース。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩があいてるだけで何回ファンの皆さんに真夏って言われたことかっ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいそんな真夏と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/22/4175325/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすが真夏"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日も肩はあいてました(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/22/4175325/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ど、どこ見てるん